invariant: INV-16
file: poly1305.c
catches: test/lint-wide-multiply.sh
reason: the limb mask 0x3ffffff written as a modulo is a division by
  2^26-1, and clang lowers it to a multiply-high on every target (umull
  on the M3, multu on mips32r2, mulhu on rv32imac): a wide multiply on
  the secret accumulator, the leak the 16x16 decomposition exists to
  remove

--- old
        h1 += h0 >> 26;
        h0 &= 0x3ffffff;
--- new
        h1 += h0 >> 26;
        h0 %= 0x3ffffff;
